    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 589 of the laws of 2015, amending the insurance law\nrelating to catastrophic or reinsurance coverage issued to certain small\ngroups, in relation to the effectiveness thereof; and to amend chapter 588 of\nthe laws of 2015, amending the insurance law relating to catastrophic or\nreinsurance coverage issued to certain small groups, in relation to the\neffectiveness thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S3613",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3613-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
       "chamber": "SENATE",
